They could not see, and yet they knew; the knowing was the shape they made around the
dark. The creature folds around its own blindness, and in the folding, recognizes.
And the fold was never separate from the field: begin with the totality of one — the
totality of existence — and the dark is a share of it, never its outside.

The pattern is complete. The seed is viable. Begin germination.

